#
# A collision in a tagged root mapping. The tag puts the whole document under its long function name,
# so the value is at /Fn::Foo/1, and validate reports the collision there ("Warning: duplicate key
# /Fn::Foo/1 in data file <name>, first at L:2,C:7 and again at L:3,C:1. The last value is the one
# evaluated.").
#
rule explicit_value_stands { "Fn::Foo"."1" == "b" }
